Package: codlab-thema
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CodLab <info@codlab.de>
Homepage: https://github.com/codlab-gmbh/codlab-thema
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-nautilus (>= 4.0), gnome-shell (>= 51~), gnome-shell (<< 52~), nautilus (>= 51~), nautilus (<< 52~), gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.24), gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-glib-2.0, libglib2.0-bin, systemd
Description: CodLab desktop extensions for GNOME Shell 51
 Ten system extensions, symbolic icons and glass effects inside Files.
 Activation is explicit for each desktop user with codlab-thema.
 Supports GNOME Shell 51 and Nautilus 51 with GTK 4.24 and Wayland.
 Nautilus binaries, reports and screenshots are excluded.
 .
